---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Certificates from '../components/Certificates.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
---

<Layout description="Hi! I'm Philip. Welcome to my website!">
    <Hero/>
    <!-- <hr/> -->
    <div class="content">
        <div class="left">
            <h2>Content</h2>
            <!-- <Image class:list={["rounded", "glowing-hover"]} src={"https://status.pigg.es/api/badge/1/status?style=for-the-badge"} alt="status" width={113} height={28} /> -->
            <p>Lorem, ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Doloremque amet placeat tempore, excepturi mollitia animi voluptatum sunt consectetur suscipit ipsa, odit dolores? Aliquam officiis, laboriosam dolorem sequi assumenda dignissimos hic a temporibus totam laborum ad qui optio impedit minima enim praesentium non distinctio! Sit amet, minus reiciendis voluptatibus sequi aspernatur quo iure hic voluptas sunt doloremque eligendi facilis nulla molestiae assumenda quae enim officia deserunt eaque vitae adipisci ipsa eius nesciunt earum. Quae exercitationem cumque nisi natus voluptatum fugit numquam.</p>
        </div>
        <aside>
            <Certificates />
        </aside>
    </div>
</Layout>
<style>

    .content {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        grid-template-rows: 1fr;
        grid-column-gap: 2em;
    }

    .content > * {
        
    }

    .content > div {
        grid-area: 1 / 1 / 2 / 4;
        padding: 1em;
        /* background-color: var(--secondary-opacity);
        border: 1px solid var(--primary-opacity); */

    }

    .content aside {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1em;
        grid-area: 1 / 4 / 2 / 5;
    }

    @media only screen and (max-width: 1000px) {
        .content {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 2em;
        }
    }
</style>
